utton><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-3 text-sm border-line text-muted">训练安排</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-3 text-sm border-line text-muted">动作与热身</button></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-muted"><span role="status" aria-live="polite">共 61 篇知识</span></div><div id="fk-learning-results" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="fk-reader-reading" tabindex="0" class="space-y-2"><details name="fk-learning-article" data-knowledge-id="EDU001" class="fk-learning-article home-card min-w-0 p-4"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 font-semibold"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words">加速、跑得快、维持速度，有什么区别？</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down fk-learning-chevron shrink-0 text-muted" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span><span class="fk-reader-conclusion mt-2 block text-sm font-normal text-muted">起速快、最高速度快、后程稳，是三个不同目标。</span></summary><div class="fk-learning-reading mt-3 space-y-3 border-t border-line pt-3 text-sm"><ul class="fk-reader-points" data-testid="reading-points"><li>加速：从慢到快</li><li>最高速度：能跑到多快</li><li>速度耐力：能把高速保持多久</li></ul><div class="fk-reader-practice"><h3>平时怎么用</h3><p>记下每段用时、休息时间和后几组的动作变化。</p></div><p class="keep text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted" data-testid="reading-note">一次短跑成绩，不能说明所有能力。</p><details class="fk-learning-sources border-t border-line"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer content-center text-xs text-muted">详细说明与来源</summary><div class="space-y-3 pb-3 text-xs leading-relaxed"><p>加速关注从低速提升速度的过程；最高速度关注快速跑姿与动作质量；速度耐力关注高速状态的持续或重复能力。训练距离、速度、组间恢复与总量应服务于明确目标。</p><p>适用范围：短距离计时不能单独判断哪种能力不足。</p><div class="border-t border-line pt-3"><p class="break-words font-medium">The Training and Development of Elite Sprint Performance</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">2019 · 研究与最佳实践整合综述</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">已核对全文中的相关章节</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">精英短跑实践存在证据空白；不复制其训练剂量到普通用户。</p></div><p class="text-muted">要打开原文，请在下方「文献阅读设置」中允许外部链接。</p></div></details></div></details><details name="fk-learning-article" data-knowledge-id="EDU002" class="fk-learning-article home-card min-w-0 p-4"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 font-semibold"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words">400米后程掉速，先看什么？</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down fk-learning-chevron shrink-0 text-muted" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span><span class="fk-reader-conclusion mt-2 block text-sm font-normal text-muted">先看前后程分段，再比较当时的条件。</span></summary><div class="fk-learning-reading mt-3 space-y-3 border-t border-line pt-3 text-sm"><ul class="fk-reader-points" data-testid="reading-points"><li>前程策略、疲劳和比赛环境都可能影响后程</li><li>一场比赛不足以确定原因</li></ul><div class="fk-reader-practice"><h3>平时怎么用</h3><p>分别记下前200米和后200米，再对照几场相似比赛。</p></div><p class="keep text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted" data-testid="reading-note">不能只凭掉速就断定某块肌肉弱。</p><details class="fk-learning-sources border-t border-line"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer content-center text-xs text-muted">详细说明与来源</summary><div class="space-y-3 pb-3 text-xs leading-relaxed"><p>400米分段变化可能受到出发策略、最高速度、速度耐力、比赛环境和疲劳等因素共同影响。单场比赛只能提出假设，不能证明唯一原因。</p><p>适用范围：一次掉速不能诊断乳酸耐受或具体肌群缺陷。</p><div class="border-t border-line pt-3"><p class="break-words font-medium">The Training and Development of Elite Sprint Performance</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">2019 · 研究与最佳实践整合综述</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">已核对全文中的相关章节</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">精英短跑实践存在证据空白；不复制其训练剂量到普通用户。</p></div><p class="text-muted">要打开原文，请在下方「文献阅读设置」中允许外部链接。</p></div></details></div></details><details name="fk-learning-article" data-knowledge-id="EDU003" class="fk-learning-article home-card min-w-0 p-4"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 font-semibold"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words">练800米，为什么既要速度也要耐力？</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down fk-learning-chevron shrink-0 text-muted" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span><span class="fk-reader-conclusion mt-2 block text-sm font-normal text-muted">既要跑得快，也要把速度维持下去。</span></summary><div class="fk-learning-reading mt-3 space-y-3 border-t border-line pt-3 text-sm"><ul class="fk-reader-points" data-testid="reading-points"><li>训练会涉及有氧、比赛配速、速度和力量</li><li>各部分怎么分配，要看基础和比赛阶段</li></ul><div class="fk-reader-practice"><h3>平时怎么用</h3><p>一起看比赛分段、专项课表现和训练后的恢复。</p></div><p class="keep text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted" data-testid="reading-note">一次1000米训练，不能保证800米能跑出某个成绩。</p><details class="fk-learning-sources border-t border-line"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer content-center text-xs text-muted">详细说明与来源</summary><div class="space-y-3 pb-3 text-xs leading-relaxed"><p>训练内容可包括有氧基础、比赛配速、速度和力量等，但比例取决于运动员背景、阶段与赛季安排。不能直接复制精英选手的周训练量。</p><p>适用范围：不能把单次1000米成绩直接换算为800米比赛保证。</p><div class="border-t border-line pt-3"><p class="break-words font-medium">Crossing the Golden Training Divide: World-Class 800- and 1500-m Runners</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">2021 · 研究与最佳实践整合综述</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">已核对摘要与关键要点</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">材料偏男性及精英实践；类别用于组织观察，不从一次训练给个人定型。</p></div><p class="text-muted">要打开原文，请在下方「文献阅读设置」中允许外部链接。</p></div></details></div></details><details name="fk-learning-article" data-knowledge-id="EDU004" class="fk-learning-article home-card min-w-0 p-4"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 font-semibold"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words">1500米，为什么要看每圈用时？</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down fk-learning-chevron shrink-0 text-muted" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span><span class="fk-reader-conclusion mt-2 block text-sm font-normal text-muted">平均配速看不出中途的快慢变化。</span></summary><div class="fk-learning-reading mt-3 space-y-3 border-t border-line pt-3 text-sm"><ul class="fk-reader-points" data-testid="reading-points"><li>耐力、速度和比赛战术都会影响成绩</li><li>分段能看出节奏变化，但不能单独解释原因</li></ul><div class="fk-reader-practice"><h3>平时怎么用</h3><p>把每圈用时与目标比较，同时记下场地和计时方式。</p></div><p class="keep text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted" data-testid="reading-note">单次训练不能精确预测比赛成绩。</p><details class="fk-learning-sources border-t border-line"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer content-center text-xs text-muted">详细说明与来源</summary><div class="space-y-3 pb-3 text-xs leading-relaxed"><p>1500米表现受到有氧能力、专项速度、节奏变化与战术影响。分段记录能帮助理解节奏，但不自动解释生理原因。</p><p>适用范围：仅凭某次训练配速无法给出精确比赛预测。</p><div class="border-t border-line pt-3"><p class="break-words font-medium">Crossing the Golden Training Divide: World-Class 800- and 1500-m Runners</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">2021 · 研究与最佳实践整合综述</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">已核对摘要与关键要点</p><p class="mt-1 text-muted">材料偏男性及精英实践；类别用于组织观察，不从一次训练给个人定型。</p></div><p class="text-muted">要打开原文，请在下方「文献阅读设置」中允许外部链接。</p></div></details></div></details><details name="fk-learning-article" data-knowledge-id="EDU005" class="fk-learning-article home-card min-w-0 p-4"><summary class="min-h-